stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ReceiveQuestion
    ReceiveQuestion --> RouterLLMCall: classify rag vs general using history
    RouterLLMCall --> QueryRewriterLLMCall: route is rag
    RouterLLMCall --> GeneralGenerationLLMCall: route is general
    QueryRewriterLLMCall --> RetrievalStep: standalone query produced
    RetrievalStep --> GroundedGenerationLLMCall: context retrieved
    GroundedGenerationLLMCall --> CritiqueLLMCall: draft answer produced
    CritiqueLLMCall --> RefinementLLMCall: unsupported claims detected
    CritiqueLLMCall --> [*]: answer well-grounded
    RefinementLLMCall --> [*]: final answer rewritten
    GeneralGenerationLLMCall --> [*]: conversational reply returned

    note right of RouterLLMCall
        One LLM, one role:
        classification
    end note

    note right of QueryRewriterLLMCall
        Same LLM, different role:
        standalone query rewriting
    end note

    note right of GroundedGenerationLLMCall
        Same LLM, different role:
        grounded answer generation
    end note

    note right of CritiqueLLMCall
        Same LLM, different role:
        self-verification
    end note